WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.901
heart pounded in his chest.

2
00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:21.464
Meanwhile the wall's shaking had grown louder.

3
00:00:22.845 --> 00:00:24.346
Rebecca Gold spoke up.

4
00:00:25.127 --> 00:00:26.788
"I'd like to try your mac and cheese."

5
00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:29.590
"Really?" Ben said.

6
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:33.377
"Really?" the two other judges said in shock.

7
00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:38.181
"Yes." Rebecca Gold picked up a fork.

8
00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:41.344
"I believe it's important to try new things."

9
00:00:42.084 --> 00:00:43.745
She glanced at the other judges.

10
00:00:43.765 --> 00:00:46.648
"You two have no sense of adventure."

11
00:00:47.628 --> 00:00:48.949
Rumble! Rumble!

12
00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:50.971
The wall shook violently.

13
00:00:51.591 --> 00:00:56.155
Ben tried to ignore it as he spooned out some of his mac and cheese for Rebecca Gold.

14
00:01:02.436 --> 00:01:03.997
"It smells wonderful, Ben."

15
00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:07.801
The judge took some on her fork and lifted it toward her mouth.

16
00:01:08.942 --> 00:01:10.363
Rumble! Rumble!

17
00:01:10.383 --> 00:01:13.465
"Can someone please fix that wall?"

18
00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:15.027
Bolton Ramsey shouted.

19
00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:19.871
"It's driving me absolutely—" Ka-boom!

20
00:01:20.391 --> 00:01:24.995
The wall exploded, and a tidal wave of hot sauce flowed into the room.

21
00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:30.820
Cameras and lights sizzled and melted as the hot sauce bubbled up around them.

22
00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:35.824
Crew members tripped over one another, all trying to reach the door.

23
00:01:35.844 --> 00:01:38.366
"What is wrong with this place?"

24
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:39.948
Bolton Ramsey shouted.

25
00:01:41.949 --> 00:01:43.891
Mayor Hubbletree held up his hands.

26
00:01:43.911 --> 00:01:47.134
"Everyone, please remain calm!

27
00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:50.917
Everything is totally under control!"

28
00:01:50.937 --> 00:01:54.160
"You call this 'under control'?"

29
00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.701
Viv Stryder cried.

30
00:01:55.721 --> 00:01:58.904
"I knew it was a bad idea to film here."

31
00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:02.811
She climbed onto a table to escape the hot sauce.

32
00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:08.956
"Yikes!" Mayor Hubbletree cried as the sauce oozed toward him.

33
00:02:09.437 --> 00:02:11.279
The mayor scrambled onto a chair.

34
00:02:11.299 --> 00:02:13.501
"Where's Freaky?

35
00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:15.462
This is his fault!"

36
00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:17.304
Ben looked around.

37
00:02:18.585 --> 00:02:22.048
The principal was huddled in a corner with his face in his hands.

38
00:02:23.009 --> 00:02:24.410
Bolton Ramsey stood up.

39
00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:25.812
"I'm leaving!"

40
00:02:26.928 --> 00:02:30.349
He stormed out of the room, with Margaret Oh following him.

41
00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:33.771
Rebecca Gold was still sitting at the table.

42
00:02:33.791 --> 00:02:34.951
"Well, Ben.

43
00:02:35.372 --> 00:02:37.112
Let's try this mac and cheese of yours."

44
00:02:39.553 --> 00:02:40.414
She took a bite.

45
00:02:49.257 --> 00:02:52.258
Delicious!" Ben was shocked.

46
00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:55.880
"Really?" The judge nodded.

47
00:02:56.264 --> 00:02:57.566
"I love monster food.

48
00:02:59.047 --> 00:03:00.709
My husband is a ghoul, you know.

49
00:03:03.071 --> 00:03:07.395
If I can give you a bit of advice, try a few more lizard tails next time.

50
00:03:08.376 --> 00:03:09.498
But it's not important.

51
00:03:09.838 --> 00:03:11.860
This is absolutely enchanting."

52
00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.624
"Gee, thanks," Ben said.

53
00:03:16.556 --> 00:03:18.898
Rebecca Gold looked around at the chaos.

54
00:03:19.679 --> 00:03:21.120
A lightbulb exploded.

55
00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.882
A cameraman held a half-melted camera in his hands.

56
00:03:25.543 --> 00:03:26.764
Wires sizzled.

57
00:03:27.964 --> 00:03:32.067
"I suppose I should go now," Rebecca Gold said.

58
00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:34.729
"Good luck, Ben.

59
00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.292
Don't stop cooking—you're very talented."

60
00:03:42.504 --> 00:03:46.107
She leaped over a pool of hot sauce and walked out of the room.

61
00:03:46.908 --> 00:03:50.851
Viv Stryder hopped down from the table and made her way to the door.

62
00:03:52.412 --> 00:03:56.976
Mayor Hubbletree followed her, wincing when he stepped in a hot sauce puddle.

63
00:03:56.996 --> 00:03:59.478
"Miss Stryder!"

64
00:04:00.018 --> 00:04:00.559
he called.

65
00:04:00.579 --> 00:04:02.060
"Please wait!

66
00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:07.725
Let's reschedule and film the show at the People Place Middle School, like you suggested!"

67
00:04:08.425 --> 00:04:09.946
Viv Stryder spun around.

68
00:04:09.966 --> 00:04:11.668
"Are you kidding?

69
00:04:12.292 --> 00:04:17.156
Sorry, Mayor, but this episode of Kids' Kitchen Showdown has been canceled!"

70
00:04:19.417 --> 00:04:20.958
The mayor's shoulders slumped.

71
00:04:22.259 --> 00:04:24.501
Mr. Freaky wandered over to the mayor.

72
00:04:25.121 --> 00:04:27.083
They both pulled out their handkerchiefs.

73
00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:29.825
Mayor Hubbletree wiped his brow.

74
00:04:29.845 --> 00:04:34.968
"Why do things like this constantly happen around here, Freaky?

75
00:04:35.569 --> 00:04:39.972
You all seem like good people, er, monsters."

76
00:04:41.212 --> 00:04:43.153
Mr. Freaky blew his noses.

77
00:04:43.173 --> 00:04:46.815
"I don't know, Mayor.

78
00:04:47.216 --> 00:04:48.957
I really don't know."

79
00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.902
The next day Ben was at home getting ready for Winnie's party.

80
00:04:59.743 --> 00:05:02.664
He placed the necklace in a small box and wrapped it.

81
00:05:02.684 --> 00:05:07.067
"I hope Winnie likes this necklace," he thought as he tied the ribbon.

82
00:05:08.328 --> 00:05:11.377
Meow! The kitten swatted at Ben's feet.

83
00:05:11.397 --> 00:05:17.281
"You have a lot of energy today," he said to the kitten.

84
00:05:18.642 --> 00:05:23.425
He'd made a few phone calls about a home for the kitten, but so far nobody wanted it.

85
00:05:25.066 --> 00:05:28.989
The kitten leaped up, nearly knocking the gift out of Ben's hand.

86
00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.972
When Ben turned to leave, the kitten followed.

87
00:05:38.632 --> 00:05:41.794
It hopped through the open door and ran down the front steps.

88
00:05:43.495 --> 00:05:44.375
Ben sighed.

89
00:05:44.395 --> 00:05:47.697
"You can't come with me.

90
00:05:47.957 --> 00:05:49.178
Go back inside!"

91
00:05:51.459 --> 00:05:54.581
He held the door open, but the kitten ignored him.

92
00:05:57.462 --> 00:05:58.323
It was getting late.

93
00:05:58.843 --> 00:06:01.504
Winnie and Gaby would be back at Winnie's house soon.

94
00:06:02.225 --> 00:06:04.366
Ben didn't have time to argue with a kitten.

95
00:06:05.547 --> 00:06:07.848
He shut the door and floated down the street.

96
00:06:08.768 --> 00:06:13.049
The kitten followed, jumping up and swatting at his feet.

97
00:06:13.789 --> 00:06:15.290
"Stop it," Ben said.

98
00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.271
As he turned to scold the kitten, he floated into a tree.

99
00:06:19.291 --> 00:06:23.872
"Ugh!" Ben cried.

100
00:06:23.892 --> 00:06:25.352
"I'm stuck!"

101
00:06:26.053 --> 00:06:28.133
He gritted his teeth and tried to move.

102
00:06:28.153 --> 00:06:31.674
"This is unbelievable!

103
00:06:31.794 --> 00:06:34.095
I haven't gotten stuck like this in a long time.

104
00:06:35.335 --> 00:06:37.156
It's all because of this annoying kitten!"

105
00:06:37.656 --> 00:06:41.720
Just then the kitten jumped up, leaping for the ribbon on the gift.

106
00:06:42.922 --> 00:06:48.149
Ben watched in horror as the gift flew out of his hand and sailed toward a storm drain.

107
00:06:48.169 --> 00:06:52.815
"No!" Ben cried as the gift slid into the drain.
